rea of the enemy ship. Tractor Clamps can also be equipped with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Plasma Torches"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Plasma_Torches"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
